ace","shared_categories":"American (New), Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Nightlife","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"D8hXDsv3TG-i2dvzgY5kLQ","review_id":"2IUHYxg2KP7AicuOwNiP9w","date":"2021-10-18T22:26:01","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9355559349060059,"text_excerpt":"I asked several people for recommendations on where to eat that might also have some live jazz music, and everyone said to go to Snug Harbor. I was happy to learn that it's a restaurant, not just a bar, so my teenage son was able to go. We arrived just after opening and were immediately seated. Unfortunately, the music is in a separate part of the restaurant, which requires tickets. Since we were there so early and not up for a late night, we enjoyed our food and then headed out. We will come back another time and get tickets to a show. The food was marvelous-we had red beans and rice, jambalaya, fried shrimp, fried chicken and broccoli. Everything we really, really good! I was full from ..."},{"business_id":"D8hXDsv3TG-i2dvzgY5kLQ","review_id":"C5f6zwnUG3QzAl3VeP0LNg","date":"2010-09-09T23:54:00","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9340425729751587,"text_excerpt":"Snug harbor is one of the best music venues in the city, at least when it comes to trad jazz. The interior of the bar is dark and mostly wood surfaces, and as a friend pointed out there are almost no straight lines inside. (The floor is sloping, the shelves behind the bar are sagging, when you look around you're hard pressed to find anything that resembles an actual straight line.) Although I'm really not a fan of paying a $15 cover, anywhere, I will say that Snug Harbor is generally worth it. They do two sets every night, 8 pm and 10 pm I believe, and the musicians are across the board top-notch. It's one of my favorite date spots, perhaps because I've been on several awesome dates there..."},{"business_id":"D8hXDsv3TG-i2dvzgY5kLQ","review_id":"63-aDryeGlHj5xSukUe5IQ","date":"2015-11-17T20:39:14","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.931298017501831,"text_excerpt":"We wondered to Frenchman street to check out some Jazz and grab a bit. Snug Harbor had great food and lots of options. I had the Filet which was pretty tasty! and way to big for me to finish. We didn't have a chance to check out the back room where the band was just starting up - but if you are on Frenchman Street and looking for a great place to eat - Snug Harbor is a great one to try."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"D8hXDsv3TG-i2dvzgY5kLQ","photo_id":"0eosiwi8YdIuJOZnfhW99Q","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/0eosiwi8YdIuJOZnfhW99Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8597124218940735},{"business_id":"D8hXDsv3TG-i2dvzgY5kLQ","photo_id":"SzXmS-ho98rbuqfmfdnzZA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/SzXmS-ho98rbuqfmfdnzZA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.813633143901825},{"b